      "content": "Your sense of irrelevance and the belief that life continues without you is a terrifying form of grief that often emerges when we feel invisible. While the world may seem to move on while we pause, your existence still holds a unique space that prevents anyone else from truly stepping into its place. Please speak to a professional who understands these profound feelings of abandonment, as healing often requires being held even when no one else acknowledges your specific pain right now.",
      "source": "target",
