      "content": "it's just so tiring to keep trying to find a \"space\" that doesn't exist. everything feels so heavy. it's like, if a song is over, you don't keep playing the silence just because you're afraid of the quiet. you just let it end. do you think there's anything wrong with wanting to just... let the song end? to just stop struggling and accept that my time is done?",
